{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 4, "line_no": 15, "text": "我国各民族都有悠久的历史，有光辉灿烂的传统文化。少数", "bbox_px": {"x": 313, "y": 1319, "w": 1050, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "我国各民族都有悠久的历史，有光辉灿烂的传统文化。少数", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 313, "y": 1319, "w": 1050, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 4, "line_no": 16, "text": "民族古籍是祖国文化宝贵遗产的一个重要组成部分。整理出版少", "bbox_px": {"x": 237, "y": 1370, "w": 1126, "h": 59}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "民族古籍是祖国文化宝贵遗产的一个重要组成部分。整理出版少", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 237, "y": 1370, "w": 1126, "h": 59}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 4, "line_no": 17, "text": "数民族古籍，继承和发扬祖国的优秀传统文化。对于我们发展社", "bbox_px": {"x": 234, "y": 1437, "w": 1129, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "数民族古籍，继承和发扬祖国的优秀传统文化。对于我们发展社", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 234, "y": 1437, "w": 1129, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 4, "line_no": 18, "text": "会主义新文化，促进社会主义精神文明建设都具有积极的作用。", "bbox_px": {"x": 230, "y": 1500, "w": 1123, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "会主义新文化，促进社会主义精神文明建设都具有积极的作用。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 230, "y": 1500, "w": 1123, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
